# Implementations

This directory groups implementation artifacts for MAMBA-NIKE.

NIKE was previously developed under the working name Mercury.

## Scope of this update

This round only performs structure and naming normalization.
KEX interface adaptation and KAT execution/verification are deferred to later
steps.

## Current organization

- `Reference_Implementation/`: existing reference-side material currently present.
- `Optimized_Implementation/`: reserved for real optimized instances already present.
- `Additional_Implementation/`: reserved for supplementary real instances already present.

## Formal instance names

- MAMBA-NIKE-128
- MAMBA-NIKE-192
- MAMBA-NIKE-256
- MAMBA-NIKE-384
- MAMBA-NIKE-512
